Package: zenoQC
Title: Quick Check Status Dashboard for the ZenoTOF 7600+
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "R.J.E.",
           family = "Derks",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "r.j.e.derks@lumc.nl")
Description: A 'golem' Shiny application that extracts the results of SCIEX
    ZenoTOF 7600+ Positive and Negative Quick Status Check reports (.xps),
    stores them in a SQLite database and shows the instrument performance
    over time with interactive 'plotly' graphs.
